 35  31 |A diagram whose natural layout is wider than the corpus width. The layout
 36  32 |backend treats the width as a hint, not a clamp, so this one comes back 119
 37  33 |columns wide at any budget. It is still drawn, with its right edge clipped
 38  34 |rather than word-wrapped into confetti: half a row of a diagram is neither the
 39  35 |diagram nor its source, while a clipped row still reads as the shape it came
 40  36 |from:
 41  36 |
 42  38 |┌───────────────────────┐  ┌───────────────────────┐  ┌───────────────────┐  ┌──
 43  38 |│ A_Very_Long_Node_Iden │  │ B_Another_Long_Node_I │ ▸│ C_And_A_Third_One │─▸│ D
 44  38 |│        tifier         │─▸│       dentifier       │─┘└───────────────────┘  └──
 45  38 |└───────────────────────┘  └───────────────────────┘
